{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fast-paced bullet hell game infused with <strong>roguelike</strong> and <strong>card</strong> <strong>mechanics</strong>. <br>Featuring a vast array of heroes, spells, and relics, the game allows endless combinations through synthesis, ensuring a fresh experience with every playthrough.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>35 spells</strong> that can be freely combined to create over <strong>2,000 unique variants</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 expansive maps</strong> and <strong>6 heroes</strong> with distinct skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>50 relics</strong> to synergize with heroes and spells, enabling <strong>thousands of strategic builds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rapid progression to challenge relentless enemy hordes and formidable bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fuse spells, unlimited creation:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700870/extras/\u5408\u6210.gif?t=1746006919\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique card and spellcasting mechanics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700870/extras/\u62bd\u5361.gif?t=1746006919\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade freely<strong>,\u00a0</strong>continuously enhanced:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700870/extras/\u4e09\u9009\u4e00.gif?t=1746006919\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience limitless creativity and ever-evolving challenges in every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steams